  "content": "\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><strong>Perception</strong> 是一款旨在通过沉浸式效果丰富游戏视觉体验的 Minecraft 模组。与专注于高度专业化的视觉效果不同，Perception 提供了精心打造的增强功能，以更全面的方式影响游戏玩法。我们的目标是为您提供看待周围世界的全新视角，让每次遭遇都更加生动和具有互动性。</p>\n<p>目前，<strong>Perception</strong> 包含两项主要功能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>投射物与实体的追踪轨迹，为周围环境增添动态的移动层次感。<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1112793/description_8d66508d-637a-4342-bdf2-f5cc78dc59c5.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"451\"></li>\n<li>由巨响、爆炸或快速移动触发的方向性屏幕震动效果。这不仅增强了沉浸感，还能帮助您精准定位潜在威胁的来源，进一步提升氛围感与环境态势感知。<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8Ci05FS.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\"></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>请注意，Perception 仍在积极开发中。其功能可能会，并且很可能会随着时间的推移而不断演变和扩展。如果您有任何新效果的创意或对现有功能的改进建议，欢迎随时在我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Discord</strong></a> 上分享。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7XhMeUr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/perception\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fperception\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fperception%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252fperception%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dRelics%2b(from%2bwww.curseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div>\n<div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想体验我们的其他模组？- 访问 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 获取更多信息！</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
